{"4808140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drive To The Top", "steam_appid": 4808140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4906480], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you navigate your car and get to the finish?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump around and climb the tricky areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/6bbe17df375bce82b0dee4a39d49fbc5.poster.avif?t=1785387811\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/6bbe17df375bce82b0dee4a39d49fbc5.webm?t=1785387811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/6bbe17df375bce82b0dee4a39d49fbc5.mp4?t=1785387811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Boost for an added speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/3094f90da4fd27750d96252af0b0a271.poster.avif?t=1785387811\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/3094f90da4fd27750d96252af0b0a271.webm?t=1785387811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/3094f90da4fd27750d96252af0b0a271.mp4?t=1785387811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grapple and swing around to get to hard to reach areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/c61198691e0ef17df58379afbe757b60.poster.avif?t=1785387811\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/c61198691e0ef17df58379afbe757b60.webm?t=1785387811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/c61198691e0ef17df58379afbe757b60.mp4?t=1785387811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like the games too easy? Get a friend over and play with split controls. Test your friendship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 person controls the acceleration and breaking, another controls the steering. Its a perfect recipe for disaster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy all the fun and challenge!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you navigate your car and get to the finish?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump around and climb the tricky areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/6bbe17df375bce82b0dee4a39d49fbc5.poster.avif?t=1785387811\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/6bbe17df375bce82b0dee4a39d49fbc5.webm?t=1785387811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/6bbe17df375bce82b0dee4a39d49fbc5.mp4?t=1785387811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Boost for an added speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/3094f90da4fd27750d96252af0b0a271.poster.avif?t=1785387811\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/3094f90da4fd27750d96252af0b0a271.webm?t=1785387811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/3094f90da4fd27750d96252af0b0a271.mp4?t=1785387811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grapple and swing around to get to hard to reach areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/c61198691e0ef17df58379afbe757b60.poster.avif?t=1785387811\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/c61198691e0ef17df58379afbe757b60.webm?t=1785387811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/extras/c61198691e0ef17df58379afbe757b60.mp4?t=1785387811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like the games too easy? Get a friend over and play with split controls. Test your friendship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 person controls the acceleration and breaking, another controls the steering. Its a perfect recipe for disaster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy all the fun and challenge!</p>", "short_description": "Jump, Swing and Boost your way to get to the finish as fast as you can! Try beating the level in both single player and 2-player co-op. How fast can you beat the game?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808140/6bf3e16ac017d1f977b0cdb7e96a70ac4f400